a) Parking slot facts
slot(s1, car, available).
slot(s2, bike, occupied).
slot(s3, car, available).
slot(s4, bike, available).
slot(s5, car, occupied).


The format is slot(SlotName, VehicleType, Status).
b) Rule for available parking
available_slot(S, V) :-
    slot(S, V, available).


c) Query for available car slots
?- available_slot(S, car).


Output:
S = s1 ;
S = s3.


Explanation: Slots S1 and S3 are available for cars. S5 is excluded because it is occupied.
